:TEST-ID tests.superset.layout_nested_constructor
:TEST-CONTEXT monadc.context.language.atom-supersets
:TEST-PURPOSE Nested layout constructor values combine in one declaration group.
:TEST-EXPECT parse-json
:TEST-MENU superset
:TEST-MENU-PATH reader/superset
:TEST-CLI-TARGET reader superset
